Package: badwolf
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, fonts-dejavu-core, fonts-liberation
Description: Walnut's web browser: Badwolf on WebKitGTK, tuned for 256 MB
 Badwolf 1.4, a small GTK 3 browser on WebKitGTK (Debian's, the 4.1 API): tabs, a location bar
 that also searches (DuckDuckGo's HTML results), back, forward, reload, a start page, downloads,
 find in page and the usual shortcuts. Patched for the PS3: every tab shares one web process and
 one network process, hardware acceleration is off (GL stays out of the web process), no
 back/forward page cache, WebGL or WebRTC, media never autoplay, JavaScript is on, and the
 User-Agent says "Walnut" so the Walnut Games site offers "Open in Walnut Games". Links in other
 schemes (walnut://, mailto:) go to the desktop's handler. Registered as x-www-browser.
